## Read & listen
A group of students began a weekly English discussion club. At first they were worried about making mistakes. Their teacher asked them to focus on communicating ideas before correcting every grammar error. After two months, the students were more willing to ask questions. They still review common mistakes at the end of each meeting.

Giáo viên đọc đoạn trên hai lần; lần đầu tìm ý chính, lần sau ghi chi tiết. Đây là kịch bản luyện nghe, chưa kèm tệp âm thanh.

