(21,5,N'A group of students began a weekly English discussion club. At first they were worried about making mistakes. Their teacher asked them to focus on communicating ideas before correcting every grammar error. After two months, the students were more willing to ask questions. They still review common mistakes at the end of each meeting.

How did the club help the students?',N'multiple_choice',1,N'Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: It increased their confidence to ask questions.',N'',1,DATEADD(MINUTE,0,DATEADD(DAY,-92,@SeedNow))),
(22,5,N'Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “review” có nghĩa là gì?',N'multiple_choice',1,N'“review” có nghĩa là “ôn tập” trong đoạn văn.',N'',2,DATEADD(MINUTE,0,DATEADD(DAY,-92,@SeedNow))),
