","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":131,"question_id":131,"question_content":"Linh planned her meals before going to the market. She bought only the ingredients she needed and stored leftovers carefully. Within a month, her household threw away less food. The change did not require a larger budget. Instead, planning helped her use what she already had and avoid buying duplicate items.\n\nWhat reduced food waste in Linh’s home?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":235,"selected_answer":"A larger food budget","correctAnswerId":236,"correct_answer":"Meal planning and careful storage","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Meal planning and careful storage","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":132,"question_id":132,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “leftovers” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":242,"selected_answer":"thức ăn còn lại","correctAnswerId":242,"correct_answer":"thức ăn còn lại","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“leftovers” có nghĩa là “thức ăn còn lại” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false}]}',80,N'',NULL),
