_id":351,"content":"Not only ___ the results, but she also explained them.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau Not only ở đầu câu cần đảo trợ động từ trước chủ ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":3159,"question_id":1753,"content":"she presented","is_correct":0},{"id":3160,"question_id":1753,"content":"did she present","is_correct":1},{"id":3161,"question_id":1753,"content":"she did present","is_correct":0},{"id":3162,"question_id":1753,"content":"presented she","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1754,"exercise_id":351,"content":"Rarely ___ we see such careful analysis.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: do. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"do","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1755,"exercise_id":351,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe agent offered the customer a refund.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “A useful customer reply”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":3163,"question_id":1755,"content":"True","is_correct":1},{"id":3164,"question_id":1755,"content":"False","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1756,"exercise_id":352,"content":"The findings should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":3165,"question_id":1756,"content":"cautious","is_correct":0},{"id":3166,"question_id":1756,"content":"caution","is_correct":1},{"id":3167,"question_id":1756,"content":"cautiously","is_correct":0},{"id":3168,"question_id":1756,"content":"cautioning","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1757,"exercise_id":352,"content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: sufficient. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"sufficient","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1758,"exercise_id":352,"content