ctise English every day","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":521,"question_id":521,"question_content":"A group of students began a weekly English discussion club. At first they were worried about making mistakes. Their teacher asked them to focus on communicating ideas before correcting every grammar error. After two months, the students were more willing to ask questions. They still review common mistakes at the end of each meeting.\n\nHow did the club help the students?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":939,"selected_answer":"It increased their confidence to ask questions.","correctAnswerId":939,"correct_answer":"It increased their confidence to ask questions.","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: It increased their confidence to ask questions.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":522,"question_id":522,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “communicate” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":941,"selected_answer":"giao tiếp","correctAnswerId":941,"correct_answer":"giao tiếp","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“communicate” có nghĩa là “giao tiếp” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":523,"question_id":523,"question_content":"He said that he ___ tired.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":946,"selected_answer":"was","correctAnswerId":946,"correct_answer":"was","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Khi tường thuật với said ở quá khứ, am/is thường lùi thành was.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":524,"question_id":524,"question_content":"She said she ___ studying English. (be)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"was","correctAnswerId":null,"cor