(112,26,25,298,NULL,N'exercise',N'Working together online · Writing & speaking',N'pending_grading',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-26,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-26,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":1486,"exercise_id":298,"content":"Despite ___ tired, she finished the task.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau despite dùng danh từ hoặc V-ing, không dùng mệnh đề độc lập.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2679,"question_id":1486,"content":"be","is_correct":0},{"id":2680,"question_id":1486,"content":"to be","is_correct":0},{"id":2681,"question_id":1486,"content":"being","is_correct":1},{"id":2682,"question_id":1486,"content":"was","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1487,"exercise_id":298,"content":"Despite the rain, they ___ outside. (play, past)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: played. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"played","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1488,"exercise_id":298,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1489,"exercise_id":298,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “Working together online”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1490,"exercise_id":298,"content":"Speak for one minute about “Working together online”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"1486":2681,"1487":"played","1488":"incorrect sample answer","1489":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","1490":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":25,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":2,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":true,"details":[{"questionId":1486,"question_id":1486,"question_content":"Despite ___ tired, she finished the task.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":2681,"selected_answer":"being","correctAnswerId":2681,"correct_answer":"being","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Sau despite dùng danh từ hoặc V-ing, không dùng mệnh đề độc lập.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1487,"question_id":1487,"question_content":"Despite the rain, they ___ outside. (play, past)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"played","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"played","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: played. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1488,"question_id":1488,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / 