},{"id":998,"exercise_id":200,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1001,"exercise_id":201,"content":"Before preparing her slides, An wrote down the three ideas she wanted her audience to remember. She chose one example for each idea and removed details that did not support her message. During practice, a friend pointed out that one chart was difficult to read. An simplified it and explained the main trend in a sentence.\n\nWhat did An do before preparing her slides?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: She identified three key ideas.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1801,"question_id":1001,"content":"She selected a decorative template.","is_correct":0},{"id":1802,"question_id":1001,"content":"She identified three key ideas.","is_correct":1},{"id":1803,"question_id":1001,"content":"She added every detail she knew.","is_correct":0},{"id":1804,"question_id":1001,"content":"She printed all the charts.","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1002,"exercise_id":201,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “support” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“support” có nghĩa là “hỗ trợ” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":1805,"question_id":1002,"content":"hỗ trợ","is_correct":1},{"id":1806,"question_id":1002,"content":"sự suy ngẫm","is_correct":0},{"id":1807,"question_id":1002,"content":"sự sửa lỗi","is_correct":0},{"id":1808,"question_id":1002,"content":"lời nhắc","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1003,"exercise_id":201,"content":"The more precisely we define the problem, ___ the solution becomes.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"So sánh kép: the + comparative...,