uestionId":371,"question_id":371,"question_content":"A small workplace survey found that staff who took short walking breaks reported better concentration. However, the survey did not measure how long each person slept or how much coffee they drank. The researcher noted that these factors might also influence the results. She recommended a larger study before drawing strong conclusions.\n\nWhy should the results be interpreted cautiously?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":667,"selected_answer":"The survey had too many participants.","correctAnswerId":670,"correct_answer":"Other relevant factors were not measured.","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Other relevant factors were not measured.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":372,"question_id":372,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “influence” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":674,"selected_answer":"ảnh hưởng","correctAnswerId":674,"correct_answer":"ảnh hưởng","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“influence” có nghĩa là “ảnh hưởng” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":373,"question_id":373,"question_content":"The report ___ by the team yesterday.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":676,"selected_answer":"was completed","correctAnswerId":676,"correct_answer":"was completed","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Bị động quá khứ đơn: was/were + quá khứ phân từ.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":374,"question_id":374,"question_content":"The window was ___ yesterday. (break)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"broken","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"broken","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: broken. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":375,"que