(163,33,21,252,NULL,N'exercise',N'Responsible tourism · Writing & speaking',N'graded',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-30,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-30,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":1256,"exercise_id":252,"content":"Had I known about the delay, I ___ earlier.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đảo ngữ điều kiện loại ba: Had + S + V3, S + would have + V3.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2265,"question_id":1256,"content":"would leave","is_correct":0},{"id":2266,"question_id":1256,"content":"would have left","is_correct":1},{"id":2267,"question_id":1256,"content":"will have left","is_correct":0},{"id":2268,"question_id":1256,"content":"had left","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1257,"exercise_id":252,"content":"Had she known, she would ___ helped.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: have. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"have","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1258,"exercise_id":252,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1259,"exercise_id":252,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “Responsible tourism”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1260,"exercise_id":252,"content":"Speak for one minute about “Responsible tourism”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"1256":2265,"1257":"have","1258":"I practise English every day.","1259":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","1260":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":71.88,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":5.75,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":false,"details":[{"questionId":1256,"question_id":1256,"question_content":"Had I known about the delay, I ___ earlier.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":2265,"selected_answer":"would leave","correctAnswerId":2266,"correct_answer":"would have left","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đảo ngữ điều kiện loại ba: Had + S + V3, S + would have + V3.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1257,"question_id":1257,"question_content":"Had she known, she would ___ helped.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"have","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"have","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: have. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1258,"question_id":1258,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English /