7,"content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":2223,"question_id":1233,"content":"is","is_correct":0},{"id":2224,"question_id":1233,"content":"are being","is_correct":0},{"id":2225,"question_id":1233,"content":"be","is_correct":1},{"id":2226,"question_id":1233,"content":"was","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1234,"exercise_id":247,"content":"The committee recommended that he ___ present.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: be. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"be","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1235,"exercise_id":247,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nMai now drives to work every day.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “A greener journey”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":2227,"question_id":1235,"content":"True","is_correct":0},{"id":2228,"question_id":1235,"content":"False","is_correct":1}]},{"id":1236,"exercise_id":248,"content":"The more precisely we define the problem, ___ the solution becomes.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"So sánh kép: the + comparative..., the + comparative...","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2229,"question_id":1236,"content":"clearer","is_correct":0},{"id":2230,"question_id":1236,"content":"the clearer","is_correct":1},{"id":2231,"question_id":1236,"content":"clearest","is_correct":0},{"id":2232,"question_id":1236,"content":"most clear","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1237,"exercise_id":248,"content":"The more you practise, the ___ you become. (confident)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: more confident. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"more confident","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1238,"exercise_id":248,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1241,"exercise_id":249,"content":"A group of students began a weekly English discussion club. At first they were worried about making mistakes. Their teacher asked them to focus on communicating ideas before correcting every grammar error. After two months, the students were more willing to ask questions. They still review common mistakes at the end of each meeting.\n\nHow did the club help the students?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: It increased their confidence to ask questions.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2233,"question_id":1241,"content":"It removed the need to study grammar.","is_correct":0},{"id":2234,"question_id":1241,"content":"It made every student a teacher.","is_correct":0},{"id":2235,"question_id":1241,"content":"It increased their confidence to ask questions.","is_correct":1},{"id":2236,"question_id":1241,"content":"It replaced all classroom lessons.","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1242,"exercise_id":249,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “communicate” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“communicate” có nghĩa là “giao tiếp” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":2237,"question_id":1242,"content":"giao tiếp","is_correct":1},{"id":2238,"question_id":1242,"content":"môi trường sống","is_correct":0},{"id":2239,"question_id":1242,"content":"bảo tồn","is_correct":0},{"id":2240,"question_id":1242,"content":"cân bằng","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1243,"exercise_id":249,"content":"The more precisely we define the problem, ___ the solution becomes.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"So sánh kép: the + comparativ