(181,35,23,270,NULL,N'exercise',N'A greener journey · Writing & speaking',N'pending_grading',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-49,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-49,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":1346,"exercise_id":270,"content":"Could I ___ a cup of tea, please?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau động từ khuyết thiếu could dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2427,"question_id":1346,"content":"having","is_correct":0},{"id":2428,"question_id":1346,"content":"had","is_correct":0},{"id":2429,"question_id":1346,"content":"have","is_correct":1},{"id":2430,"question_id":1346,"content":"has","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1347,"exercise_id":270,"content":"She can ___ very well. (swim)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: swim. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"swim","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1348,"exercise_id":270,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1349,"exercise_id":270,"content":"Write 60–90 words about “A greener journey”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1350,"exercise_id":270,"content":"Speak for one minute about “A greener journey”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"1346":2429,"1347":"incorrect sample answer","1348":"I practise English every day.","1349":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","1350":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":25,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":2,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":true,"details":[{"questionId":1346,"question_id":1346,"question_content":"Could I ___ a cup of tea, please?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":2429,"selected_answer":"have","correctAnswerId":2429,"correct_answer":"have","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Sau động từ khuyết thiếu could dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1347,"question_id":1347,"question_content":"She can ___ very well. (swim)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"incorrect sample answer","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"swim","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đáp án: swim. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1348,"question_id":1348,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":n