ontent":"Not only ___ the results, but she also explained them.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau Not only ở đầu câu cần đảo trợ động từ trước chủ ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":1323,"question_id":733,"content":"she presented","is_correct":0},{"id":1324,"question_id":733,"content":"did she present","is_correct":1},{"id":1325,"question_id":733,"content":"she did present","is_correct":0},{"id":1326,"question_id":733,"content":"presented she","is_correct":0}]},{"id":734,"exercise_id":147,"content":"Rarely ___ we see such careful analysis.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: do. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"do","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":735,"exercise_id":147,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nMai now drives to work every day.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “A greener journey”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":1327,"question_id":735,"content":"True","is_correct":0},{"id":1328,"question_id":735,"content":"False","is_correct":1}]},{"id":736,"exercise_id":148,"content":"The findings should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1329,"question_id":736,"content":"cautious","is_correct":0},{"id":1330,"question_id":736,"content":"caution","is_correct":1},{"id":1331,"question_id":736,"content":"cautiously","is_correct":0},{"id":1332,"question_id":736,"content":"cautioning","is_correct":0}]},{"id":737,"exercise_id":148,"content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: sufficient. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"sufficient","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":738,"exercise_id":148,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: