(203,37,14,160,NULL,N'exercise',N'Responsible tourism · Writing & speaking',N'pending_grading',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-38,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-38,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":796,"exercise_id":160,"content":"The findings should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1437,"question_id":796,"content":"cautious","is_correct":0},{"id":1438,"question_id":796,"content":"caution","is_correct":1},{"id":1439,"question_id":796,"content":"cautiously","is_correct":0},{"id":1440,"question_id":796,"content":"cautioning","is_correct":0}]},{"id":797,"exercise_id":160,"content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: sufficient. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"sufficient","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":798,"exercise_id":160,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":799,"exercise_id":160,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “Responsible tourism”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":800,"exercise_id":160,"content":"Speak for one minute about “Responsible tourism”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"796":1438,"797":"sufficient","798":"I practise English every day.","799":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","800":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":37.5,"correctCount":3,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":3,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":true,"details":[{"questionId":796,"question_id":796,"question_content":"The findings should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1438,"selected_answer":"caution","correctAnswerId":1438,"correct_answer":"caution","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":797,"question_id":797,"question_content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"sufficient","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"sufficient","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: sufficient. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":798,"question_id":798,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh