ish every day.|I practise English every day","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":871,"question_id":871,"question_content":"A small workplace survey found that staff who took short walking breaks reported better concentration. However, the survey did not measure how long each person slept or how much coffee they drank. The researcher noted that these factors might also influence the results. She recommended a larger study before drawing strong conclusions.\n\nWhy should the results be interpreted cautiously?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1570,"selected_answer":"Other relevant factors were not measured.","correctAnswerId":1570,"correct_answer":"Other relevant factors were not measured.","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Other relevant factors were not measured.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":872,"question_id":872,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “concentration” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1571,"selected_answer":"mơ hồ","correctAnswerId":1572,"correct_answer":"sự tập trung","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"“concentration” có nghĩa là “sự tập trung” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":873,"question_id":873,"question_content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1577,"selected_answer":"be","correctAnswerId":1577,"correct_answer":"be","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false}]}',80,N'',NULL),
