"is_correct":1},{"id":3078,"question_id":1706,"content":"was","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1707,"exercise_id":342,"content":"The committee recommended that he ___ present.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: be. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"be","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1708,"exercise_id":342,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1711,"exercise_id":343,"content":"A customer wrote to ask why a parcel had not arrived. The support agent apologised, explained the delay and gave a new delivery date. She also offered to cancel the order if the customer preferred a refund. The customer appreciated receiving a clear choice rather than a vague promise.\n\nWhat did the customer appreciate?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: A clear choice and specific information","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":3079,"question_id":1711,"content":"A clear choice and specific information","is_correct":1},{"id":3080,"question_id":1711,"content":"An automatic advertisement","is_correct":0},{"id":3081,"question_id":1711,"content":"A longer waiting period","is_correct":0},{"id":3082,"question_id":1711,"content":"An unexplained promise","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1712,"exercise_id":343,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “parcel” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“parcel” có nghĩa là “bưu kiện” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":3083,"question_id":1712,"content":"xu hướng","is_correct":0},{"id":3084,"question_id":1712,"content":"bưu kiện","is_correct":1},{"id":3085,"question_id":1712,"content":"người nghe","is_correct":0},{"id":30