anation":"So sánh kép: the + comparative..., the + comparative...","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":3105,"question_id":1723,"content":"clearer","is_correct":0},{"id":3106,"question_id":1723,"content":"the clearer","is_correct":1},{"id":3107,"question_id":1723,"content":"clearest","is_correct":0},{"id":3108,"question_id":1723,"content":"most clear","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1724,"exercise_id":345,"content":"The more you practise, the ___ you become. (confident)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: more confident. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"more confident","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1725,"exercise_id":345,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nAn kept every detail she knew in her presentation.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “Planning a presentation”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":3109,"question_id":1725,"content":"True","is_correct":0},{"id":3110,"question_id":1725,"content":"False","is_correct":1}]},{"id":1726,"exercise_id":346,"content":"The proposal was rejected on the ___ that it lacked evidence.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cụm cố định on the grounds that nghĩa là với lý do rằng.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":3111,"question_id":1726,"content":"grounded","is_correct":0},{"id":3112,"question_id":1726,"content":"ground","is_correct":0},{"id":3113,"question_id":1726,"content":"grounds","is_correct":1},{"id":3114,"question_id":1726,"content":"grounding","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1727,"exercise_id":346,"content":"The conclusion is based ___ the available evidence.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: on hoặc upon. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"on|upon","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1728,"exercise_id":346,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1731,"exercise_id":347,"content":"A language app reminded learners to practise a few minutes each day. Although the reminders increased the number of logins, some learners completed tasks without reviewing their mistakes. The teacher therefore added a short reflection after each exercise. Learners had to explain one correction in their own words before moving on.\n\nWhy did the teacher add a reflection task?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To encourage understanding of corrections","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":3115,"question_id":1731,"content":"To reward logins alone","is_correct":0},{"id":3116,"question_id":1731,"content":"To remove practice reminders","is_correct":0},{"id":3117,"question_id":1731,"content":"To encourage understanding of corrections","is_correct":1},{"id":3118,"question_id":1731,"content":"To make the app unavailable","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1732,"exercise_id":347,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “reminder” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“reminder” có nghĩa là “lời nhắc” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":3119,"question_id":1732,"content":"bằng chứng","is_correct":0},{"id":3120,"question_id":1732,"content":"khẳng định","is_correct":0},{"id":3121,"question_id":1732,"content":"hạn chế","is_correct":0},{"id":3122,"question_id":1732,"content":"lời nhắc","is_correct":1}]},{"id":1733,"exercise_id":347,"content":"The proposal was rejected on the ___ that it lacked evidence.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cụm cố định on the grounds that nghĩa là với lý do rằng.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":3123,"question_id":1733,"content":"gro