ry day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1581,"exercise_id":317,"content":"A school considered replacing printed handouts with digital materials. Some teachers welcomed the lower printing costs, while others worried about screen time and unequal access to devices. Before making a decision, the school tested both approaches with two classes. Feedback showed that a combination of printed summaries and online practice worked best.\n\nWhy did the school test both approaches?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To compare benefits and practical problems","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2845,"question_id":1581,"content":"To avoid collecting feedback","is_correct":0},{"id":2846,"question_id":1581,"content":"To remove all printed books","is_correct":0},{"id":2847,"question_id":1581,"content":"To compare benefits and practical problems","is_correct":1},{"id":2848,"question_id":1581,"content":"To increase printing costs","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1582,"exercise_id":317,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “feedback” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“feedback” có nghĩa là “phản hồi” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":2849,"question_id":1582,"content":"ảnh hưởng","is_correct":0},{"id":2850,"question_id":1582,"content":"kết luận","is_correct":0},{"id":2851,"question_id":1582,"content":"phản hồi","is_correct":1},{"id":2852,"question_id":1582,"content":"sự tập trung","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1583,"exercise_id":317,"content":"I have lived here ___ 2020.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Since dùng với mốc thời gian; for dùng với khoảng thời gian.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"