:"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1051,"exercise_id":211,"content":"A language app reminded learners to practise a few minutes each day. Although the reminders increased the number of logins, some learners completed tasks without reviewing their mistakes. The teacher therefore added a short reflection after each exercise. Learners had to explain one correction in their own words before moving on.\n\nWhy did the teacher add a reflection task?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To encourage understanding of corrections","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1891,"question_id":1051,"content":"To reward logins alone","is_correct":0},{"id":1892,"question_id":1051,"content":"To remove practice reminders","is_correct":0},{"id":1893,"question_id":1051,"content":"To encourage understanding of corrections","is_correct":1},{"id":1894,"question_id":1051,"content":"To make the app unavailable","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1052,"exercise_id":211,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “reflection” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“reflection” có nghĩa là “sự suy ngẫm” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":1895,"question_id":1052,"content":"hạn chế","is_correct":0},{"id":1896,"question_id":1052,"content":"sự suy ngẫm","is_correct":1},{"id":1897,"question_id":1052,"content":"bằng chứng","is_correct":0},{"id":1898,"question_id":1052,"content":"khẳng định","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1053,"exercise_id":211,"content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":1899,"question_id":1053,"content":"is","is_correct":0},{"id":1900,"question_id":1053,"content":"are being","is_correct":0},{"id":1901,"question_id":1053,"content":"be","is_