which. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"that|which","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":448,"exercise_id":90,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":451,"exercise_id":91,"content":"Minh found two articles about urban transport. One listed clear research methods and recent data, while the other made strong claims without naming its sources. He checked who wrote each article and whether the evidence supported the conclusion. He decided that the first article was more useful for his assignment, although it still had limitations.\n\nWhy did Minh prefer the first article?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: It explained its methods and evidence.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":811,"question_id":451,"content":"It used more dramatic language.","is_correct":0},{"id":812,"question_id":451,"content":"It was the shortest article.","is_correct":0},{"id":813,"question_id":451,"content":"It made the strongest unsupported claims.","is_correct":0},{"id":814,"question_id":451,"content":"It explained its methods and evidence.","is_correct":1}]},{"id":452,"exercise_id":91,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “evidence” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“evidence” có nghĩa là “bằng chứng” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":815,"question_id":452,"content":"cư dân","is_correct":0},{"id":816,"question_id":452,"content":"bằng chứng","is_correct":1},{"id":817,"question_id":452,"content":"kéo dài","is_correct":0},{"id":818,"question_id":452,"content":"đặt trước","is_correct":0}]},{"id":453,"exercise_id":91,"content":"The person ___ helped me is a tea