s after work.\n\nWhy did the library change its opening hours?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":902,"selected_answer":"All books had been sold.","correctAnswerId":901,"correct_answer":"Residents wanted access after work.","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Residents wanted access after work.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":502,"question_id":502,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “residents” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":907,"selected_answer":"cư dân","correctAnswerId":907,"correct_answer":"cư dân","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“residents” có nghĩa là “cư dân” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":503,"question_id":503,"question_content":"I have lived here ___ 2020.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":911,"selected_answer":"since","correctAnswerId":911,"correct_answer":"since","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Since dùng với mốc thời gian; for dùng với khoảng thời gian.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":504,"question_id":504,"question_content":"She has worked here ___ five years.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"for","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"for","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: for. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":505,"question_id":505,"question_content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe library closes at eight on weekdays.","type":"true_false","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":913,"selected_answer":"True","correctAnswerId":913,"correct_answer":"True","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “A community library”.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":506,"question_id"