ông có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":751,"question_id":751,"question_content":"A coastal town limits the number of visitors to its protected island. Local guides explain how tourism supports jobs but may also damage wildlife habitats. Visitors are asked to carry reusable bottles and stay on marked paths. Income from tickets helps fund conservation work. The policy aims to balance economic benefits with environmental protection.\n\nWhat is the main aim of the visitor policy?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1354,"selected_answer":"To balance income and protection","correctAnswerId":1354,"correct_answer":"To balance income and protection","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To balance income and protection","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":752,"question_id":752,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “habitat” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1356,"selected_answer":"môi trường sống","correctAnswerId":1356,"correct_answer":"môi trường sống","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“habitat” có nghĩa là “môi trường sống” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":753,"question_id":753,"question_content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1361,"selected_answer":"be","correctAnswerId":1361,"correct_answer":"be","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false}]}',80,N'',NULL),
