(407,63,7,78,NULL,N'exercise',N'A useful customer reply · Writing & speaking',N'pending_grading',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-35,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-35,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":386,"exercise_id":78,"content":"The person ___ helped me is a teacher.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Who là đại từ quan hệ chỉ người, làm chủ ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":699,"question_id":386,"content":"which","is_correct":0},{"id":700,"question_id":386,"content":"whose","is_correct":0},{"id":701,"question_id":386,"content":"who","is_correct":1},{"id":702,"question_id":386,"content":"where","is_correct":0}]},{"id":387,"exercise_id":78,"content":"This is the book ___ I told you about.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: that hoặc which. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"that|which","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":388,"exercise_id":78,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":389,"exercise_id":78,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “A useful customer reply”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":390,"exercise_id":78,"content":"Speak for one minute about “A useful customer reply”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"386":701,"387":"incorrect sample answer","388":"I practise English every day.","389":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","390":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":25,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":2,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":true,"details":[{"questionId":386,"question_id":386,"question_content":"The person ___ helped me is a teacher.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":701,"selected_answer":"who","correctAnswerId":701,"correct_answer":"who","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Who là đại từ quan hệ chỉ người, làm chủ ngữ.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":387,"question_id":387,"question_content":"This is the book ___ I told you about.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"incorrect sample answer","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"that|which","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đáp án: that hoặc which. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":388,"question_id":388,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","po