(433,67,22,262,NULL,N'exercise',N'A greener journey · Writing & speaking',N'graded',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-33,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-33,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":1306,"exercise_id":262,"content":"They are ___ football now.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Hiện tại tiếp diễn có dạng be + V-ing.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2355,"question_id":1306,"content":"play","is_correct":0},{"id":2356,"question_id":1306,"content":"plays","is_correct":0},{"id":2357,"question_id":1306,"content":"playing","is_correct":1},{"id":2358,"question_id":1306,"content":"played","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1307,"exercise_id":262,"content":"I am ___ a book now. (read)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: reading. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"reading","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1308,"exercise_id":262,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1309,"exercise_id":262,"content":"Write 60–90 words about “A greener journey”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1310,"exercise_id":262,"content":"Speak for one minute about “A greener journey”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"1306":2357,"1307":"reading","1308":"incorrect sample answer","1309":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","1310":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":81.25,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":6.5,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":false,"details":[{"questionId":1306,"question_id":1306,"question_content":"They are ___ football now.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":2357,"selected_answer":"playing","correctAnswerId":2357,"correct_answer":"playing","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Hiện tại tiếp diễn có dạng be + V-ing.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1307,"question_id":1307,"question_content":"I am ___ a book now. (read)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"reading","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"reading","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: reading. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1308,"question_id":1308,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"incorrect sample answer","correctAnswerId":null,