y day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"I practise English every day.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":261,"question_id":261,"question_content":"A small workplace survey found that staff who took short walking breaks reported better concentration. However, the survey did not measure how long each person slept or how much coffee they drank. The researcher noted that these factors might also influence the results. She recommended a larger study before drawing strong conclusions.\n\nWhy should the results be interpreted cautiously?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":472,"selected_answer":"Other relevant factors were not measured.","correctAnswerId":472,"correct_answer":"Other relevant factors were not measured.","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Other relevant factors were not measured.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":262,"question_id":262,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “conclusion” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":473,"selected_answer":"hoàn tiền","correctAnswerId":475,"correct_answer":"kết luận","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"“conclusion” có nghĩa là “kết luận” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":263,"question_id":263,"question_content":"The findings should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":478,"selected_answer":"caution","correctAnswerId":478,"correct_answer":"caution","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","earnedPoints":1,