gs should be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":3070,"selected_answer":"caution","correctAnswerId":3070,"correct_answer":"caution","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1704,"question_id":1704,"question_content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"sufficient","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"sufficient","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: sufficient. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1705,"question_id":1705,"question_content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe survey measured how much coffee every participant drank.","type":"true_false","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":3074,"selected_answer":"False","correctAnswerId":3074,"correct_answer":"False","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “Evidence and healthy habits”.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1706,"question_id":1706,"question_content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":3075,"selected_answer":"is","correctAnswerId":3077,"correct_answer":"be","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1707,"question_id":1707,"question_content":"The committee recommended that he ___ present.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"be","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"be","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: be. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1708,"question