(504,75,19,226,NULL,N'exercise',N'Technology and study habits · Writing & speaking',N'graded',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-19,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-19,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":1126,"exercise_id":226,"content":"The proposal was rejected on the ___ that it lacked evidence.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cụm cố định on the grounds that nghĩa là với lý do rằng.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":2031,"question_id":1126,"content":"grounded","is_correct":0},{"id":2032,"question_id":1126,"content":"ground","is_correct":0},{"id":2033,"question_id":1126,"content":"grounds","is_correct":1},{"id":2034,"question_id":1126,"content":"grounding","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1127,"exercise_id":226,"content":"The conclusion is based ___ the available evidence.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: on hoặc upon. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"on|upon","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1128,"exercise_id":226,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":1129,"exercise_id":226,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “Technology and study habits”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1130,"exercise_id":226,"content":"Speak for one minute about “Technology and study habits”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"1126":2033,"1127":"on","1128":"incorrect sample answer","1129":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","1130":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":81.25,"correctCount":2,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":6.5,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":false,"details":[{"questionId":1126,"question_id":1126,"question_content":"The proposal was rejected on the ___ that it lacked evidence.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":2033,"selected_answer":"grounds","correctAnswerId":2033,"correct_answer":"grounds","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Cụm cố định on the grounds that nghĩa là với lý do rằng.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1127,"question_id":1127,"question_content":"The conclusion is based ___ the available evidence.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"on","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"on|upon","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: on hoặc upon. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":1128,"question_id":1128,"question_content":