ensive rewards, encouraged her to change her routine.\n\nWhat encouraged Mai to cycle to work?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1117,"selected_answer":"A cash prize","correctAnswerId":1118,"correct_answer":"Reliable facilities at work","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: Reliable facilities at work","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":622,"question_id":622,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “routine” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1123,"selected_answer":"thói quen","correctAnswerId":1123,"correct_answer":"thói quen","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“routine” có nghĩa là “thói quen” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":623,"question_id":623,"question_content":"I have lived here ___ 2020.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1127,"selected_answer":"since","correctAnswerId":1127,"correct_answer":"since","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Since dùng với mốc thời gian; for dùng với khoảng thời gian.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":624,"question_id":624,"question_content":"She has worked here ___ five years.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"for","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"for","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: for. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":625,"question_id":625,"question_content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nMai now drives to work every day.","type":"true_false","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":1130,"selected_answer":"False","correctAnswerId":1130,"correct_answer":"False","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “A greener journey”.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":626,"qu