(526,79,1,4,NULL,N'exercise',N'A greener journey · Writing & speaking',N'graded',DATEADD(MINUTE,5,DATEADD(DAY,-57,@SeedNow)),NULL,DATEADD(MINUTE,12,DATEADD(DAY,-57,@SeedNow)),N'[{"id":16,"exercise_id":4,"content":"I have lived here ___ 2020.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Since dùng với mốc thời gian; for dùng với khoảng thời gian.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":33,"question_id":16,"content":"for","is_correct":0},{"id":34,"question_id":16,"content":"during","is_correct":0},{"id":35,"question_id":16,"content":"since","is_correct":1},{"id":36,"question_id":16,"content":"from","is_correct":0}]},{"id":17,"exercise_id":4,"content":"She has worked here ___ five years.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: for. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"for","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":18,"exercise_id":4,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":19,"exercise_id":4,"content":"Write 120–180 words about “A greener journey”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","correct_text":"","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":20,"exercise_id":4,"content":"Speak for one minute about “A greener journey”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: mạch lạc, từ vựng, cấu trúc và phát âm nếu có bản ghi âm. Với bản chép lời, giáo viên chỉ nhận xét nội dung/ngôn ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[]}]',N'{"16":35,"17":"for","18":"I practise English every day.","19":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","20":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly."}',N'{"scorePercentage":84.38,"correctCount":3,"totalQuestions":5,"earnedPoints":6.75,"totalPoints":8,"pending_grading":false,"details":[{"questionId":16,"question_id":16,"question_content":"I have lived here ___ 2020.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":35,"selected_answer":"since","correctAnswerId":35,"correct_answer":"since","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Since dùng với mốc thời gian; for dùng với khoảng thời gian.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":17,"question_id":17,"question_content":"She has worked here ___ five years.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"for","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"for","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: for. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":18,"question_id":18,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"I practise English every day.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":19,"question_id":19,"question_content":"Write 120–180 words about “A greener journey”. Give an opinion and two supporting examples.","type":"essay","points":3,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"In my opinion, small changes can improve the way we learn and work. For example, planning a short activity every day makes a large goal easier to manage. It also helps us notice problems early. In our study group, we compare ideas and explain our answers instead of memorising a list. This is useful because a clear example often reveals what we do not understand. However, the plan should remain flexible: people have different schedules and need time to rest. I would review the plan each week and choose one thing to improve.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Tiêu chí: hoàn thành yêu cầu, tổ chức ý, từ vựng và ngữ pháp. Giáo viên đọc bài và phản hồi; không chấm chỉ bằng độ dài.","earnedPoints":2.25,"needs_grading":false,"teacher_feedback":"Ý rõ và có ví dụ. Tiếp tục sửa cách liên kết câu và dùng từ chính xác hơn."},{"questionId":20,"question_id":20,"question_content":"Speak for one minute about “A greener journey”. Give your opinion and one example. Submit a transcript or a recording link.","type":"speaking","points":2,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"Transcript: I think this topic matters because it affects daily decisions. For example, our class tried a short discussion before each lesson. We listened to different opinions and asked for examples. I became more confident when I prepared three key words first. Next time I would speak more slowly and explain my reason clearly.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":