ave","is_correct":0},{"id":1414,"question_id":783,"content":"would have left","is_correct":1},{"id":1415,"question_id":783,"content":"will have left","is_correct":0},{"id":1416,"question_id":783,"content":"had left","is_correct":0}]},{"id":784,"exercise_id":157,"content":"Had she known, she would ___ helped.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: have. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"have","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":785,"exercise_id":157,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe club reviews common mistakes after each meeting.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “Learning beyond the classroom”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":1417,"question_id":785,"content":"True","is_correct":1},{"id":1418,"question_id":785,"content":"False","is_correct":0}]},{"id":786,"exercise_id":158,"content":"Not only ___ the results, but she also explained them.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau Not only ở đầu câu cần đảo trợ động từ trước chủ ngữ.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1419,"question_id":786,"content":"she presented","is_correct":0},{"id":1420,"question_id":786,"content":"did she present","is_correct":1},{"id":1421,"question_id":786,"content":"she did present","is_correct":0},{"id":1422,"question_id":786,"content":"presented she","is_correct":0}]},{"id":787,"exercise_id":158,"content":"Rarely ___ we see such careful analysis.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: do. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"do","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":788,"exercise_id":158,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","correct_text":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","order_index":3,"answers":[]},{"id":791,"exercise_id":159,"content":"A coastal town limits the number of visitors to its protected island. Local guides explain how tourism supports jobs but may also damage wildlife habitats. Visitors are asked to carry reusable bottles and stay on marked paths. Income from tickets helps fund conservation work. The policy aims to balance economic benefits with environmental protection.\n\nWhat is the main aim of the visitor policy?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To balance income and protection","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":1423,"question_id":791,"content":"To end all tourism","is_correct":0},{"id":1424,"question_id":791,"content":"To build more hotels","is_correct":0},{"id":1425,"question_id":791,"content":"To replace local guides","is_correct":0},{"id":1426,"question_id":791,"content":"To balance income and protection","is_correct":1}]},{"id":792,"exercise_id":159,"content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “conservation” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"“conservation” có nghĩa là “bảo tồn” trong đoạn văn.","correct_text":"","order_index":2,"answers":[{"id":1427,"question_id":792,"content":"đồng nghiệp","is_correct":0},{"id":1428,"question_id":792,"content":"hạn chót","is_correct":0},{"id":1429,"question_id":792,"content":"sự nhầm lẫn","is_correct":0},{"id":1430,"question_id":792,"content":"bảo tồn","is_correct":1}]}]',N'{"781":1407,"782":1410,"783":1414,"784":"have","785":1417,"786":1420,"787":"incorrect sample answer","788":"I practise English every day.","791":1426,"792":1430}',N'{"scorePercentage":80,"correctCount":8,"totalQuestions":10,"earnedPoints":8,"totalPoints":10,"pending_grading":false,"details":[{"questionId":781,"question_id":781,"question_content":"A group of students began a weekly English discussion club. At first they were worried about making mistakes. Their teacher asked them to focus on communicating