ts":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"I practise English every day.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":401,"question_id":401,"question_content":"A language app reminded learners to practise a few minutes each day. Although the reminders increased the number of logins, some learners completed tasks without reviewing their mistakes. The teacher therefore added a short reflection after each exercise. Learners had to explain one correction in their own words before moving on.\n\nWhy did the teacher add a reflection task?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":721,"selected_answer":"To reward logins alone","correctAnswerId":723,"correct_answer":"To encourage understanding of corrections","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: To encourage understanding of corrections","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":402,"question_id":402,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “correction” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":725,"selected_answer":"sự sửa lỗi","correctAnswerId":725,"correct_answer":"sự sửa lỗi","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“correction” có nghĩa là “sự sửa lỗi” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":403,"question_id":403,"question_content":"He said that he ___ tired.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":730,"selected_answer":"was","correctAnswerId":730,"correct_answer":"was","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Khi tường thuật với said ở quá khứ, am/is thường lùi thành was.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":404,"question_id":404,"question_content":"She said she ___ studying English. (be)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"was","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"was","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: was. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":405,"question_id":405,"question_content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe reflection asked learners to explain a correction.","type":"true_false","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":733,"selected_answer":"True","correctAnswerId":733,"correct_answer":"True","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “Technology and study habits”.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":406,"question_id":406,"question_content":"Despite ___ tired, she finished the task.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":735,"selected_answer":"be","correctAnswerId":737,"correct_answer":"being","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Sau despite dùng danh từ hoặc V-ing, không dùng mệnh đề độc lập.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":407,"question_id":407,"question_content":"Despite the rain, they ___ outside. (play, past)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"played","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"played","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án: played. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":408,"question_id":408,"question_content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: every day / English / I / practise","type":"ordering","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"I practise English every day.","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"I practise English every day.|I practise English every day","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Câu khẳng định: chủ ngữ + động từ + tân ngữ + trạng ngữ. Chấp nhận có hoặc không có dấu chấm.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":411,"question_id":411,"question_content":"Minh found two articles about urban transport. One listed clear research methods and recent data, while the other made strong claims without naming its sources. He checked who wrote each article and whether the evidence supported the conclusion. He decided that the first article was more useful for his assignment, although it still had limitations.\n\nWhy did Minh prefer the first article?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":742,"selected_answer":"It explained its methods and evidence.","correctAnswerId":742,"correct_answer":"It explained its methods and evidence.","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đối chiếu thông tin trong đoạn văn: It explained its methods and evidence.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":412,"question_id":412,"question_content":"Trong ngữ cảnh bài đọc, “limitation” có nghĩa là gì?","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":746,"selected_answer":"hạn chế","correctAnswerId":746,"correct_answer":"hạn chế","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"“limitation” có nghĩa là “hạn chế” trong đoạn văn.","earnedPoints":1,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":413,"question_id":413,"question_content":"Despite ___ tired, she finished the task.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":747,"selected_answer":"be","correctAnswerId":749,"correct_answer":"being","isCorrect":false,"is_correct":false,"explanation":"Sau despite dùng danh từ hoặc V-ing, không dùng mệnh đề độc lập.","earnedPoints":0,"needs_grading":false},{"questionId":414,"question_id":414,"question_content":"Despite the rain, they ___ outside. (play, past)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"selectedAnswerId":null,"selected_answer":"played","correctAnswerId":null,"correct_answer":"played","isCorrect":true,"is_correct":true,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: played. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","earnedPoints":1,