uld be interpreted with ___.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Sau giới từ with cần danh từ caution; cautious là tính từ.","correct_text":"","order_index":3,"answers":[{"id":3069,"question_id":1703,"content":"cautious","is_correct":0},{"id":3070,"question_id":1703,"content":"caution","is_correct":1},{"id":3071,"question_id":1703,"content":"cautiously","is_correct":0},{"id":3072,"question_id":1703,"content":"cautioning","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1704,"exercise_id":341,"content":"The evidence is not ___ to prove the claim. (suffice)","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án chấp nhận: sufficient. Kiểm tra thì, cấu trúc và dạng từ trong câu.","correct_text":"sufficient","order_index":4,"answers":[]},{"id":1705,"exercise_id":341,"content":"Dựa vào đoạn văn, nhận định sau đúng hay sai?\nThe survey measured how much coffee every participant drank.","type":"true_false","points":1,"explanation":"Kiểm tra chi tiết trực tiếp trong đoạn văn về “Evidence and healthy habits”.","correct_text":"","order_index":5,"answers":[{"id":3073,"question_id":1705,"content":"True","is_correct":0},{"id":3074,"question_id":1705,"content":"False","is_correct":1}]},{"id":1706,"exercise_id":342,"content":"It is essential that the data ___ checked carefully.","type":"multiple_choice","points":1,"explanation":"Cấu trúc giả định sau essential/recommend dùng động từ nguyên mẫu.","correct_text":"","order_index":1,"answers":[{"id":3075,"question_id":1706,"content":"is","is_correct":0},{"id":3076,"question_id":1706,"content":"are being","is_correct":0},{"id":3077,"question_id":1706,"content":"be","is_correct":1},{"id":3078,"question_id":1706,"content":"was","is_correct":0}]},{"id":1707,"exercise_id":342,"content":"The committee recommended that he ___ present.","type":"fill_blank","points":1,"explanation":"Đáp án: be. Đọc lại toàn bộ câu sau khi điền.","correct_text":"be","order_index":2,"answers":[]},{"id":1708,"exercise_id":342,"content":"Sắp xếp các từ thành câu hoàn chỉnh: